  "name": "Shifter Weapon Familiarity",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You favour the weapons common to shifters. You are trained with the @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.LGgvev6AV0So8tP9]{Hatchet}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.zSAoyzcf3nSeZCiF]{Kama}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.TDrO7Xdyn7juFy3c]{Kukri}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.grmaV4GdoGD7sKbn]{Scimitar}, and @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.ynnBwzkzsR6B73iO]{Sickle}. In addition, you gain access to kama, kukris, and all uncommon shifter weapons. For you, martial shifter weapons are simple weapons and advanced shifter weapons are martial weapons.</p>"
    },
